<Layout title="Fundraising Policy | Manchester Select"><section class="policy"><div class="eyebrow">Manchester Select</div><h1>Fundraising Policy</h1><p class="lead">Our fundraising is built around honesty, transparency, respect and a clear connection between sporting activity and charitable purpose.</p><h2>Our principles</h2><ul><li>We describe fundraising opportunities and sponsorship packages accurately.</li><li>We treat supporters, donors, sponsors and beneficiaries with respect.</li><li>We keep appropriate records of funds raised and how event activity supports our charitable objectives.</li><li>We do not pressure people into donating or participating.</li></ul><h2>Events and sponsorship</h2><p>Sponsorship contributions support Manchester Select events and our fundraising mission for The Christie. Specific benefits are communicated before an agreement is made.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>If you have a question about a fundraising activity, contact hello@manchesterselectrl.co.uk before making a contribution.</p></section></Layout>
